  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan bargains with a female Gu Immortal’s resolute will in treasure yellow heaven over pill azure incense quality and price, then buys in bulk when she will not discount. The purchase costs almost ten thousand immortal essence stones.",
      "chapters": [
        1114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "treasure-yellow-heaven-buy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After inspection he moves the stock into his sovereign immortal aperture and stores it in Mini Azure Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "treasure-yellow-heaven-buy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_azure_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pill azure incense resembles jade smoke that constantly blows around and creates a hazy area. It is very fragrant, with the smell of ink and grass, elegant and long lasting. Fang Yuan sets mortal Gu formations only to keep it within a certain area so it does not disperse.",
      "chapters": [
        1114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-smoke-fragrance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pill azure incense is the food that Change Soul Immortal Gu eats. It does not renew itself; once used, it is gone. Fang Yuan judges the batch enough to feed Change Soul three times, and notes that it is widely sold in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "change-soul-food",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_change_soul_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pill azure incense grows where primeval essence is present together with pill crane groups, azure pine forests, ink bamboo forests, and herb incense Gu. Those four living requirements must each reach a certain quantity, or the incense cannot form, and the exact amounts are a trade secret held by sellers.",
      "chapters": [
        1114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "production-conditions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Mini Azure Heaven the stored incense appears as azure fog: the pill azure incense Fang Yuan bought, kept there with a heavenly crystal storage pool that has no use for the moment.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mini-azure-heaven-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A further check still lists a lot of pill azure incense in Mini Azure Heaven as Change Soul Immortal Gu’s food, beside that same unused heavenly crystal pool from Hei Fan grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mini-azure-heaven-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another survey finds the batch from the earlier purchase still at Mini Azure Heaven’s center next to the useless heavenly crystal storage pool.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mini-azure-heaven-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
